Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他呀 怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是个相当纯粹的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.59,0:00:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,正直 不论发生什么都不动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,正因如此 他比任何人都强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,第一眼我就看出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我打心底感到满足的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你一人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感受到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的怒火 你的杀意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.14,0:01:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,多么地 多么地滚烫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,沸腾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我体内的岩浆 要喷发了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.64,0:01:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你的想象越强力 它就越快速
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,越强劲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 忍者男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,完全无法伤你分毫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的忍者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.36,0:02:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但我…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不后悔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,上次心情这么舒爽 是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一起上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.69,0:02:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,休想死个痛快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你个施虐狂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是今早送到总部的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是对我们示威
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他好强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次穿就能把具足装备活用到那种程度
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,真想拿到他的操作数据啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,迪莉 能跟他商量吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.23,0:04:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为他几乎不可能回应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:04:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,能花钱请他来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,准备相应的报酬 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这不美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会是打算为部下复仇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要加快计划
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,唯有大义 必须成就
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 他们不会打过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,穿具足装备的干部在组织里也有着绝对实力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但你杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们至少会等到有能确保杀死你的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还会回想起日本的天空吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.57,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,候鸟不需要故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它们眼中只有遥远的山丘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如此想着 飞向天空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,回过神来 只剩两只
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.11,0:06:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我会永远追随着您
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我解除禁令
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,由你来杀了彼岸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.71,0:06:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样热情地盯着我 让我很为难的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,先说好了 我不接受成家的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你想问什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟鞠是什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有她 才有了现在的我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你是忍者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一时犹豫就会丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,记好了 新人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.73,0:07:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我姑且算你通过测试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是我的搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠是我的第一任上司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她不论何时都能冷静而稳健地完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,她的身姿 正是我心中描绘的理想忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那时 组织中有三位不容小觑的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在 你 还有鞠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都觉得 你们三人中会有一人继承组织
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,务必牢记
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者是为荣誉而生的阴影
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,舍弃自我 舍弃情感
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,终其一生守护日本
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我们的夙愿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直戴着那个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,能问为什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,出过事故 脸被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,成了目不忍睹的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的父母甚至无法直视我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,离开了我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,孤身一人的我 后来被组织收养
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你的脸已算不上是体面人的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但正因如此 你能变装成任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,今后请作为忍者活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我受这番话指引
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,开始研习变装术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为了能变成任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,摘下来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请别这样 我太丑陋…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 在我看来你比任何人都美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这张脸 正是你身为忍者的荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,多么不可思议的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.05,0:10:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被她那样一说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.90,0:10:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的觉得就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她不光是值得尊敬的忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还是值得尊敬的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我和彼岸还有在是同期
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从小就一起训练
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,对他们我诚惶诚恐 不敢接近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不用这么害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.47,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别看他俩那样 其实也有孩子气的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,以前还有过这种事?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那两人对我来说非常重要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.97,0:10:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我有些担心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太过接近会萌生感情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,感情会在战场上扰乱判断
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因此为戒律所禁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,感情会杀死忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,厌生死交替之海 而羡涅槃之山
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能让对方暂时陷入假死状态
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,伪装成是死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就传授给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但我听说奥义是不能说给别人听的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为总有一天 你会需要它的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.19,0:11:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,现在想来 那段时日
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是我身为忍者最幸福的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.51,0:11:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,结束得那么突然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,可悲可叹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者该在刀刃之下保持本心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.66,0:12:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但这些人寻求的只有杀敌的刀刃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要引来这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,山路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,训练正按照计划进行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,汇报完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为忍者的荣誉是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是保护日本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.74,0:12:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那日本消失了 忍者也会消失吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如同飘渺幻影那般?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.33,0:13:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这样下去 组织会完全变样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想那样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.01,0:13:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只要鞠成为新首领 继承组织的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有一件事 我必须告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有了我的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我爱上了一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,既然打破了戒律 我也无法留在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,再过几个月 就会踢腿了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还会踢腿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道忍者的活法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但我即将成为父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.21,0:14:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一起成为 这个孩子的父母吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.09,0:14:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,协商结果 我们离开日本的统治
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,开始接受大国的管理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,违背此次决定的人 叛离的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,将被视作叛忍被组织解决
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要抛弃日本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,丧失荣誉之时 就是忍者的忌日
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么就不明白呢 山路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你从开始就打算把组织收入囊中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这人已不是我们的同胞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是条沉醉于可耻欲望的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,狗吗 那你们想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还用问
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是你的葬身之处
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是代表忍者的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不亡 忍者就不会亡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今只有一条路可走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,要杀了山路他们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,请您和我们一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起上的话 也许能杀死他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但恐怕事成之后我们没人能活下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那样一来 传承了几百年的忍者之魂将会断绝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是真正的死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.10,0:16:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,离开这片土地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕背上叛忍的污名
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只要还活着 志向就能传递给未来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是我们该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,用了这个 就能不被组织发现而逃离吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.79,0:17:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一直以来独自开发的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,希望有一天能帮上某人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,请为了大家 为了同胞们收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好 你的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我背负着前任首领派给我的绝密任务
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是检验下任首领是否有资格担此重任
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不够格 就将其葬送
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,前任已经去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,正因如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我此刻舍弃任务 那前任的意志也会消散
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 一直瞒着你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:17:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我从一开始就注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还请…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还请放弃那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再次作为忍者…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你果然隐藏了实力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是看守人 所以靠假象欺瞒众人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我已想不起父母的面容
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,每当我试图回忆 就会想起你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:19:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一瞬间 你护住了那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你不那么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不动手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经什么都想不明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想作为一名忍者而活
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,而组织却变得不像从前那样了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,脱离组织 作为叛忍苟且偷生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有何荣誉可言
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,与其难堪地苟延残喘
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不如像忍者一样死去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,忍者没有感情 所以不理解何谓家人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我有了孩子 有了家人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这重新给予了我活着的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,感情不会杀死忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而会给予忍者生命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也把你当作我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,以后你作何打算
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算就这样留在组织
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟需要有人 从内部监视他们在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这一定能成为同胞们的助力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.02,0:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,另外 我还是看守人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.61,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的任务 我潜入了FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,上司虽然有些怪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但似乎不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边每天都是战场
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,想不到养小孩居然这么辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,或许比当忍者的时候还要艰苦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:21:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,鞠不论何时都是为了守护而战
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她才是真正的忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因此我必须完成自己的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直留在组织不断调查
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,调查首领 山路的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在推进某项计划
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs55}注：出自万叶集 卷十六 3849
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Screen
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}As the memories fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.50,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The lives of those who weren’t saved
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.75,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Regret and torment has come to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Hopelessly leading us astray
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}On a journey to find some kind of reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}The army’s weight is only crumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Haunted by the look of those who we’ve left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Close your eyes, try to leave the shame behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will stay to lend a helping hand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}When death is knocking at the door
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:38.63,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Who will fight alone for what is right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.30,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}For the ones who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_EN_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}Those who were left behind
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.66,0:21:45.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当记忆渐渐模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.50,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些未被挽救的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:55.75,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}后悔与折磨长留心中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:00.51,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}使我们绝望迷失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.05,0:22:08.18,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}在寻找理由的旅途之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:13.10,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当队伍开始分崩离析
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.65,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}被抛弃之人的面庞挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:22.86,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}闭上眼睛想忘记愧疚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:28.16,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会留下伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.74,0:22:33.29,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}当死亡已经近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:38.63,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}谁会独自战斗追寻正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:43.30,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}为那些被抛弃的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:46.26,ED_CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,720)\blur2}那些被抛弃的人们
Comment: 0,0:00:00.46,0:00:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
